Z||000000||Cooter||12-08-2001||09:13 PM||||I have too many projects going on and was thinking about trying to sell my 88 GT. It has a 3.4, 4 speed w/4.10's, T/A leather power lumbar seats, 16 in. Sunfire GT 3 spoke wheels, new poly everywhere, new ball joints, tie rod ends, rack bushing, lowered 1.5 inches, new rotors, rebuilt calipers, braided SS lines, rear wheel bearings, new shift cables and so much more than I can think of. The paint is not too bad, but really needs buffing and the headliner needs to be re-covered. The ECM is setup for a positive pressure intake sytem so upgrading to a turbo or supercharger will not require any extra add-ons. Keep it, sell the 3.4/4 speed and install a Caddy 4.9 or sell it outright and build a new Fiero with the Caddy? Suggestions?||||reg||1
